msgid "Error selecting camera"
msgstr "Gwall wrth ddewis camera"

#: src/onboarding.py:560
msgid "The selected camera cannot be opened"
msgstr "Nid oes modd agor y camera a ddewiswyd"

#: src/onboarding.py:560
msgid "Try to select another one"
msgstr "Ceisiwch ddewis un arall"

#: src/onboarding.py:575
msgid ""
"Please visit\n"
"<a href=\"https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter\">https://"
"github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter</a>\n"
"to enable your ir emitter"
msgstr ""
"Ymwelwch\n"
"<a href=\"https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter\">https://"
"github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter</a>\n"
"i alluogi eich allyrrydd ir"

#: src/onboarding.py:643
msgid "Setup lighting 1"
msgstr "Gosodiad goleuo 1"

#: src/onboarding.py:644
msgid "Setup lighting 2"
msgstr "Gosodiad goleuo 2"

#: src/onboarding.py:662
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "Methu arbed model wyneb"

#: src/onboarding.py:667 src/onboarding.py:714
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "Sganio ail fodel"

#: src/onboarding.py:673
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Methwyd recordio'r ail fodel"

#: src/onboarding.py:674
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. The room must still "
"be bright enough to see your face — change the light rather than turning it "
"off — then try again, or skip and add a model later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Mae eich model cyntaf yn cael ei gadw, felly mae mewngofnodi wyneb eisoes yn "
"gweithio. Rhaid i'r ystafell fod yn ddigon llachar o hyd i weld eich wyneb - "
"newidiwch y golau yn hytrach na'i ddiffodd - yna ceisiwch eto, neu sgipiwch "
"ac ychwanegwch fodel yn ddiweddarach o'r Gosodiadau."

#: src/onboarding.py:708
msgid "Second scan: different lighting"
msgstr "Ail sgan: goleuadau gwahanol"

#: src/onboarding.py:710
msgid ""
"First model saved. Now change the light — for example turn a lamp on or off, "
"move away from the window, or use the other room light — keep your face "
"clearly visible, then press Scan again."
msgstr ""
"Model cyntaf wedi'i arbed. Nawr newidiwch y golau - er enghraifft trowch "
"lamp ymlaen neu i ffwrdd, symudwch i ffwrdd o'r ffenestr, neu defnyddiwch "
"olau'r ystafell arall - cadwch eich wyneb yn amlwg, yna pwyswch Scan eto."

#: src/onboarding.py:752
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware and tools..."
msgstr ""
"Gall Ubuntu Hello ddatgloi eich {} yn awtomatig gan ddefnyddio dilysiad "
"wyneb (waled canfyddedig: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Statws TPM:</b> Wrthi'n gwirio caledwedd ac offer TPM..."

#: src/onboarding.py:772
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> "
"automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Gall Ubuntu Hello ddatgloi eich {} yn awtomatig gan ddefnyddio dilysiad "
"wyneb (waled canfyddedig: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Statws TPM:</b> Wedi canfod caledwedd TPM. Yn gosod <i>tpm2-tools</i> yn "
"awtomatig..."

#: src/onboarding.py:784
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active. Your password will be securely "
"sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Gall Ubuntu Hello ddatgloi eich {} yn awtomatig gan ddefnyddio dilysiad "
"wyneb (waled canfyddedig: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Statws TPM:</b> Caledwedd TPM 2.0 yn weithredol. Bydd eich cyfrinair yn "
"cael ei selio'n ddiogel y tu mewn i'r TPM."

#: src/onboarding.py:786
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, but automatic installation of "
"<i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. "
"Falling back to software-based credential caching."
msgstr ""
"Gall Ubuntu Hello ddatgloi eich {} yn awtomatig gan ddefnyddio dilysiad "
"wyneb (waled canfyddedig: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Statws TPM:</b> Wedi canfod caledwedd TPM, ond methodd gosod <i>tpm2-"
"tools</i> yn awtomatig. Rhedeg <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. "
"Syrthio'n ôl i caching credential seiliedig ar feddalwedd."

#: src/onboarding.py:788
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detected. Using software-based credential "
"caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Gall Ubuntu Hello ddatgloi eich {} yn awtomatig gan ddefnyddio dilysiad "
"wyneb (waled canfyddedig: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Statws TPM:</b> Dim caledwedd TPM wedi'i ganfod. Defnyddio caching "
"credential seiliedig ar feddalwedd (AES-256-GCM)."

