#: src/main.ui:135
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Lighting changes how your face looks to the "
"camera, so a single model can fail in the evening under lamps (or in "
"daylight). Add a second model recorded in different light to keep unlocking "
"reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Dim ond un model wyneb sydd wedi'i gofrestru. Mae goleuo'n newid sut mae'ch "
"wyneb yn edrych i'r camera, felly gall model sengl fethu gyda'r nos o dan "
"lampau (neu yng ngolau dydd). Ychwanegwch ail fodel a gofnodwyd mewn golau "
"gwahanol i gadw datgloi yn ddibynadwy ar unrhyw adeg o'r dydd."

