msgstr "Croeso i Ubuntu Hello"

#: src/onboarding.ui:51
msgid "Setup is done!"
msgstr "Mae'r gosodiad wedi'i wneud!"

#: src/onboarding.ui:67
msgid ""
"We're done! Ubuntu Hello is now active on this computer. Try doing anything "
"you would normally have to type your password for to authenticate, like "
"running a command with sudo. If you enabled keyring auto-unlock, your login "
"keyring or KWallet will also be unlocked automatically on login.\n"
"\n"
"You can open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator later on to change more advanced "
"settings or add additional models. Press Finish below to close this window "
"and open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator. "
msgstr ""
"Rydyn ni wedi gorffen! Mae Ubuntu Hello bellach yn weithredol ar y "
"cyfrifiadur hwn. Ceisiwch wneud unrhyw beth y byddai'n rhaid i chi fel arfer "
"deipio'ch cyfrinair i'w ddilysu, fel rhedeg gorchymyn gyda sudo. Os "
"gwnaethoch alluogi datgloi cylch allweddi yn awtomatig, bydd eich cylch "
"allweddi mewngofnodi neu KWallet hefyd yn cael ei datgloi'n awtomatig wrth "
"fewngofnodi.\n"
"\n"
"Gallwch agor y Cyflunydd Ubuntu Hello yn nes ymlaen i newid gosodiadau mwy "
"datblygedig neu ychwanegu modelau ychwanegol. Pwyswch Gorffen isod i gau'r "
"ffenestr hon ac agorwch y Cyflunydd Ubuntu Hello."

#: src/onboarding.ui:103
msgid "Setting a certainty policy"
msgstr "Gosod polisi sicrwydd"

#: src/onboarding.ui:119
msgid ""
"Because of changes in angles, distance, and other factors a face match is "
"never exactly the same as the stored face model. On this page you can set "
"how strict Ubuntu Hello should be."
msgstr ""
"Oherwydd newidiadau mewn onglau, pellter, a ffactorau eraill nid yw "
"cydweddiad wyneb byth yn union yr un fath â'r model wyneb sydd wedi'i "
"storio. Ar y dudalen hon gallwch chi osod pa mor llym y dylai Ubuntu Hello "
"fod."

#: src/onboarding.ui:149
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Cyflym"

#: src/onboarding.ui:158
msgid ""
"Allows more fuzzy matches, \n"
"but speeds up the scanning process greatly."
msgstr ""
"Yn caniatáu mwy o gemau niwlog, \n"
"ond yn cyflymu'r broses sganio yn fawr."

#: src/onboarding.ui:181
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Cytbwys"

#: src/onboarding.ui:190
msgid ""
"Still relatively quick detection, \n"
"but might not log you in when further away."
msgstr ""
"Dal i ganfod yn gymharol gyflym, \n"
"ond efallai na fydd yn eich mewngofnodi pan fyddwch ymhellach i ffwrdd."

#: src/onboarding.ui:212
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "Diogel"

#: src/onboarding.ui:222
msgid ""
"The slightly safer option, \n"
"but will take much longer to authenticate you"
msgstr ""
"Yr opsiwn ychydig yn fwy diogel, \n"
"ond bydd yn cymryd llawer mwy o amser i'ch dilysu"

#: src/onboarding.ui:332
msgid "Skip for now"
msgstr "Hepgor am y tro"

#: src/onboarding.ui:337
msgid ""
"You can add more face models later from Settings or with: sudo ubuntu-hello "
"add"
msgstr ""
"Gallwch ychwanegu rhagor o fodelau wyneb yn nes ymlaen o'r Gosodiadau neu "
"gyda: sudo ubuntu-hello add"

#: src/onboarding.ui:355 src/onboarding.ui:482
msgid "Configuring webcam"
msgstr "Ffurfweddu gwe-gamera"

#: src/onboarding.ui:387
msgid "Is the infrared emitter flashing ?"
msgstr "A yw'r allyrrydd isgoch yn fflachio?"

#: src/onboarding.ui:399
msgid ""
"Look at the camera you selected: an infrared camera shows a small light that "
"blinks while Ubuntu Hello tests it. This tells us whether it can see your "
"face in the dark."
msgstr ""
"Edrychwch ar y camera a ddewisoch: mae camera isgoch yn dangos golau bach "
"sy'n blincio tra bod Ubuntu Hello yn ei brofi. Mae hyn yn dweud wrthym a all "
"weld eich wyneb yn y tywyllwch."

#: src/onboarding.ui:433
msgid "Yes, it flashes"
msgstr "Ydy, mae'n fflachio"

#: src/onboarding.ui:459
msgid "No, nothing flashes"
msgstr "Na, dim byd yn fflachio"

#: src/onboarding.ui:498
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello will search your system automatically for any available "
"cameras, so make sure your webcam is connected. After detection a list of "
"usable webcams will be shown. Pick the one you want to use and click Next."
msgstr ""
"Bydd Ubuntu Hello yn chwilio'ch system yn awtomatig am unrhyw gamerâu sydd "
"ar gael, felly gwnewch yn siŵr bod eich gwe-gamera wedi'i gysylltu. Ar ôl "
"canfod, dangosir rhestr o we-gamerâu defnyddiadwy. Dewiswch yr un rydych chi "
"am ei ddefnyddio a chliciwch ar Next."

#: src/onboarding.ui:517
msgid "Testing your webcams, please wait..."
msgstr "Wrth brofi eich gwe-gamerâu, arhoswch..."

#: src/onboarding.ui:563
msgid "Downloading data files"
msgstr "Lawrlwytho ffeiliau data"

#: src/onboarding.ui:579
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello needs three pre trained facial recognition datasets to be able "
"to recognise you, which will be downloaded now. You can see the download "
"progress below."
msgstr ""
"Mae angen tair set ddata adnabod wynebau wedi'u hyfforddi ymlaen llaw ar "
"Ubuntu Hello i'ch adnabod, a fydd yn cael eu llwytho i lawr nawr. Gallwch "
"weld y cynnydd lawrlwytho isod."

#: src/onboarding.ui:603
msgid "Starting download..."
msgstr "Yn dechrau llwytho i lawr..."

#: src/onboarding.ui:646
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello!"
msgstr "Croeso i Ubuntu Hello!"

#: src/onboarding.ui:658
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Fersiwn"

#: src/onboarding.ui:672
msgid ""
"This wizard will walk you through the setup process and automatically "
"configure Ubuntu Hello for you. Press next to continue."
msgstr ""
"Bydd y dewin hwn yn eich arwain trwy'r broses sefydlu ac yn ffurfweddu "
"Ubuntu Hello yn awtomatig i chi. Pwyswch nesaf i barhau."

#: src/onboarding.ui:723
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your login keyring or KWallet using "
"face authentication, preventing password prompts after logging in."
msgstr ""
"Gall Ubuntu Hello ddatgloi eich cylch allweddi mewngofnodi yn awtomatig neu "
"KWallet ddefnyddio dilysu wynebau, atal awgrymiadau cyfrinair ar ôl "
"mewngofnodi."

#: src/onboarding.ui:735
msgid "Enable automatic keyring/KWallet unlocking"
msgstr "Galluogi cylch allweddi awtomatig / datgloi KWallet"

#: src/onboarding.ui:763
msgid "Confirm password"
msgstr "Cadarnhau cyfrinair"

#: src/onboarding.ui:820
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Yn ol"

#: src/onboarding.ui:855
msgid "Finish setup"
msgstr "Gorffen gosod"

#: src/onboarding.ui:882
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Nesaf"

#: ubuntu-hello-gtk.desktop.in
msgid "Windows Hello style facial authentication"
msgstr "Dilysiad wyneb arddull Windows Hello"

#: ubuntu-hello-gtk.desktop.in
msgid "face;recognition;authentication;security;lock;"
msgstr "wyneb; cydnabyddiaeth; dilysu; diogelwch; clo;"
